{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "label": "Exactly where it suspends", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_sync_until_first_await", "label": "Async body is synchronous until the first await", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An async function is not asynchronous until it reaches an await. Top-level code, up to and including the first await, runs synchronously on the caller's stack."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_await_evaluates_immediately", "label": "await evaluates its expression immediately", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The expression runs now; only the waiting is deferred. That is why starting work before awaiting it turns a waterfall into parallel work."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_await_suspends_and_returns", "label": "await suspends and returns control to the caller", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After the expression is evaluated, the rest of the body is registered as a continuation and control exits the function."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_one_tick_minimum", "label": "await always costs at least one tick", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Even when the promise is already fulfilled, execution still pauses until the next tick. There is no fast path."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_continuation_is_microtask", "label": "await continuation is a microtask", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An await loop never yields to rendering, because rendering happens between tasks."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_await_non_promise", "label": "await converts non-promises via Promise.resolve", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The value comes back unchanged, so await is safe on a value that may or may not be a promise \u2014 but it is converted, not skipped, which is why the tick is spent either way."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_thenable_assimilation", "label": "Thenables are assimilated by await", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "await cares about the shape, not the class. An object with an unrelated then field gets assimilated rather than returned."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_top_level_await", "label": "Top-level await", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A module that awaits at the top level delays evaluation of every module that imports it. Not available in CommonJS because require is synchronous."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_shared_scope", "label": "await-split pieces share one scope", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "user is an ordinary const visible to every later line, where a chain would have to thread it through handler arguments."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_mdn_await", "label": "MDN await operator", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/await", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_sync_until_first_await", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_await_evaluates_immediately", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_await_suspends_and_returns", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_one_tick_minimum", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_continuation_is_microtask", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_where_it_suspends", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_07_async_await_02_where_it_suspends_await_non_promise", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/07-async-await/02-where-it-suspends.md